        "hash": "cd987227d5b0862c2876c190779fbe5233d262ae",
        "subject": "fix(console): every name in both scripts, checked beside its field; never the API's validation words",
        "body": "fix(console): every name in both scripts, checked beside its field; never the API's validation words\n\nCreating a business on dukan-test answered \"ownerNameAr must be a string\"\nand \"businessNameAr must be a string\": the deployed console predates the\nArabic name fields the API now requires. This change, on top of 638f1d6\n(which added those fields), makes the forms say what is wrong themselves:\n\n- src/lib/names.ts mirrors the API's name rules exactly\n  (erp-backend common/bilingual-name.ts): Latin and Arabic scripts, blank,\n  length, hidden characters.\n- New business: each Latin field is labelled \"(Latin letters)\", each Arabic\n  field is right-to-left; the business's and the Owner's two names are\n  required, the first store's two go together or not at all (as the DTO).\n  Checked before the step-up, the message beside the field in the\n  operator's language, a summary above the buttons; nothing is sent and\n  nothing typed is lost. The browser's own bubbles are off (noValidate).\n- Names editor (business, store, person) and the Owner portal's store\n  request (Arabic name optional there, as the API has it) use the same\n  rules and field messages.\n- Field takes an error, outside the label (the field keeps its name) and\n  pointed to by aria-describedby.\n- ErrorNotice: the API's validation wording is never shown — \"check the\n  highlighted fields\" instead; other server sentences only on an English\n  screen; a refusal the page worded itself still shows in every language.\n\nTests: bilingual creation with every name mapped to its field, missing\nArabic names, wrong scripts, a store's Arabic name alone, a raw 400 never\nshown with the answers kept, FR and AR field messages, the mirrored rules.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
        "author": {
          "name": "CLAUDE",
          "email": "abdelkerim.mahfoudh@gmail.com",
          "time": 1793483549000
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "CLAUDE",
          "email": "abdelkerim.mahfoudh@gmail.com",
